1. Screen OnVisible
Set(varCalRegion, LookUp(Choices('Meeting Notes'.Region), Text(Value) = "EMEA").Value);
Set(varShowModal, false);
Select(lblLoadData)

Text(Value) converts the OptionSetValue to its label so the comparison works. .Value at the end hands back an OptionSetValue, which is what Patch and Filter both need.

2. lblCellHit.OnSelect (in the component)
Set(varCalSelected, ThisItem.CellDate);
If(
    !ThisItem.InMonth,
    Set(varCalMonth, Date(Year(ThisItem.CellDate), Month(ThisItem.CellDate), 1))
);
Set(varCurrentMeeting, LookUp(colMeetings, DateValue(Text('Meeting Date', "yyyy-mm-dd")) = ThisItem.CellDate));
ClearCollect(
    colEditActions,
    ForAll(
        varCurrentMeeting.'Meeting Action Items' As A,
        {
            TempID: GUID(),
            ActionRec: A,
            Descr: A.'Action Description',
            Assignee: A.'Assigned To',
            Stat: Text(A.Status),
            Removed: false
        }
    )
);
Set(varShowModal, true)

Meeting = varCurrentMeeting compared Record to Record — not allowed. Relationship navigation replaces it and kills the delegation warning too.
